              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Nobles have hand weapon, light armour, javelins and thrusting spears. Light cavalry. Wedge. Stealth. May have heavy armour (+1) and shield (+1). All Cavalry may be upgraded to Warband for (+1) point a model.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
