              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Warriors have hand weapon, javelins and buckler. Light Cavalry. Stealth. All Cavalry may be upgraded to Warband for (+1) point a model. Warrior Cavalry not upgraded to Warband are Ld6 (+1) point Every second cavalry unit in the army may be Nobles.</characteristic>
